    "kind": "consumable",
    "slug": "consumable:aurochs-jerky",
    "name": "Aurochs Jerky",
    "level": 9,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["alchemical", "consumable", "processed"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "triumph-of-the-tusk"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Interact"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aurochs meat already makes for tough jerky, but with the right alchemical treatment, it becomes legendarily resilient and imparts that durability to those who eat it. Eating the jerky causes a pair of inch-long horns to grow from your forehead (or causes your existing horns to grow noticeably) for 1 hour. During this time, you gain a +1 item bonus to Fortitude saves. You can end the effect prematurely, causing the horns to retract or revert to their normal size, with a free action that has the concentrate trait."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "f6fa229e-6a5a-5ac0-9414-350854f6ba8e"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aurochs' Endurance",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "free"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You begin your turn and are "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5e3582c3-701c-5169-9c69-4221096722c2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You suppress the fatigued condition for 10 minutes. During this time, you are not immune to fatigue and can become fatigued by subsequent effects, but you gain a +2 item bonus to saving throws against effects that would fatigue you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5a32bfca-b76c-5ded-8635-e49d0dea6a7a"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
